  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "よく　なつくので　しょしんしゃに\nおすすめのポケモンと　いわれるが\nそだつと　きしょうは　あらくなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "잘 따르기 때문에 초보자에게\n추천하는 포켓몬으로 불리지만\n크면 기질이 거칠어진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常容易親近，據說是適合\n推薦給新手訓練家的寶可夢。\n可是一旦成長，脾氣就會變得粗暴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comme il s’attache facilement à son Dresseur,\non le conseille souvent aux débutants, bien qu’il\nait tendance à devenir plus rebelle avec l’âge.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses sehr zutrauliche Pokémon wird oft\nfrischgebackenen Trainern empfohlen.\nMit dem Alter wird es jedoch immer wilder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su carácter amigable lo convierte en el Pokémon\nideal para Entrenadores novatos. Sin embargo, al\ncrecer suele volverse un poco agresivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È ritenuto un Pokémon ideale per Allenatori\nalle prime armi perché si affeziona facilmente.\nCrescendo, però, tende a diventare aggressivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s considered to be a good Pokémon for\nbeginners because of its friendliness, but its\ndisposition grows rougher as it grows up.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "よく　なつくので　初心者に\nお勧めのポケモンと　いわれるが\n育つと　気性は　荒くなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "非常容易亲近，因此据说是\n适合推荐给新手训练家的宝可梦。\n可一旦成长，脾气就会变粗暴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su carácter amigable lo convierte en el Pokémon\nideal para Entrenadores novatos. Sin embargo, al\ncrecer suele volverse un poco agresivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "むかしから　ひとと　くらしてきた。\nトレーナーが　かなしんでいると\nそれを　さっして　そばを　はなれない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "옛날부터 사람과 살아왔다.\n트레이너가 슬퍼하면\n그것을 헤아리고 곁을 떠나지 않는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "從過去開始就一直和人類生活。\n當訓練家感到悲傷的時候，\n牠會察覺到，並不會離開對方身邊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon vit depuis toujours avec les\nhumains. Lorsque son Dresseur est triste, il\nreste à ses côtés pour le soutenir moralement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebte schon immer mit Menschen zusammen\nund kann spüren, wenn sein Trainer traurig ist.\nEs weicht dann nicht mehr von seiner Seite.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Acostumbran a vivir con los humanos desde la\nantigüedad. Intuyen si su Entrenador está\ntriste, en cuyo caso no se despegan de su lado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Questo Pokémon vive insieme agli esseri umani\nda tempo immemore. Se il suo Allenatore è triste,\nresta al suo fianco per sostenerlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon has lived with people since times\nlong ago. It can sense when its Trainer is in the\ndumps and will stick close by its Trainer’s side.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "昔から　人と　暮らしてきた。\nトレーナーが　悲しんでいると\nそれを　察して　側を　離れない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从一开始就一直和人类生活。\n当训练家悲伤的时候，\n它会察觉到，不会离开对方的身边。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Acostumbran a vivir con los humanos desde la\nantigüedad. Intuyen si su Entrenador está\ntriste, en cuyo caso no se despegan de su lado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "そだつに　つれて　きしょうは　あらく\nこうげきてきに　なる。　もてあまして\nすてる　トレーナーも　すくなくない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "자라면서 거칠고 공격적으로\n변한다. 감당이 안 돼서\n버리는 트레이너도 적지 않다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在成長的過程中，性情會漸漸\n變得粗暴而有攻擊性。也有不少\n訓練家因為應付不了而遺棄牠。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il devient de plus en plus sauvage et agressif en\ngrandissant. Il n’est pas rare que son Dresseur\nl’abandonne, ne sachant plus qu’en faire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit dem Alter werden sie immer angriffslustiger\nund wilder. Trainer, die damit nicht umgehen\nkönnen, setzen sie deshalb oft aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A medida que crece, se vuelve más salvaje y\nagresivo. No son pocos los Entrenadores que\nse deshacen de él por no poder controlarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Più cresce e più diventa impetuoso e aggressivo.\nNon sono pochi gli Allenatori che se ne liberano\nquando non sono più in grado di gestirlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "As they develop, their disposition grows more\nviolent and aggressive. Many Trainers find them\ntoo much to handle and abandon them.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "育つに　つれて　気性は　荒く\n攻撃的に　なる。　持て余して\n捨てる　トレーナーも　少なくない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "随着成长，性格也会变得\n粗暴而有攻击性。因难以应付\n而丢弃它的训练家也不少。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A medida que crece, se vuelve más salvaje y\nagresivo. No son pocos los Entrenadores que\nse deshacen de él por no poder controlarlo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くびの　いわを　こすりつけてくるのは\nしんあいの　あかし。　ただし　いわは\nするどいので　かなり　いたいぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목에 있는 바위를 비벼대는 것은\n친밀하다는 증거다. 단 바위는\n날카로워서 꽤 아프다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用脖子上的岩石來摩蹭，\n代表彼此感情深厚。但因為\n岩石很銳利，所以會很痛。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il frotte les cailloux pointus de son cou\ncontre son Dresseur en signe d’affection.\nC’est adorable, mais douloureux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Reibt es seinen steinernen Fellkragen an einem\nTrainer, ist das ein Zeichen seiner Zuneigung. Da\ner jedoch scharf ist, besteht Verletzungsgefahr.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Restriega las rocas que tiene en el cuello contra\nsu Entrenador como señal de afecto, pero son\ntan puntiagudas que hacen bastante daño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sfrega le appuntite pietre del suo collo\naddosso agli altri. È un segno di affetto\nabbastanza doloroso!",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it rubs the rocks on its neck against you,\nthat’s proof of its love for you. However, the\nrocks are sharp, so the gesture is quite painful!",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "首の　岩を　こすりつけてくるのは\n親愛の　証。　ただし　岩は\n鋭いので　かなり　痛いぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "把脖子上的岩石蹭过来是\n感情深厚的证明。\n但是岩石很锋利，相当疼。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Restriega las rocas que tiene en el cuello contra\nsu Entrenador como señal de afecto, pero son\ntan puntiagudas que hacen bastante daño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "よく　なつくが　かみぐせが\nあるので　ずっと　そだてるには\nなかなか　ほねが　おれるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
